### Register User

POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vdnmrao1992@gmail.com",
  "username": "raovarre",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "firstName": "Rao",
  "lastName": "Varre"
}

### Email Verification

GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/verify?token=123487d5-3abc-4754-b14a-cbe51972e670


### Login

POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "raovarre",
    "password": "Password@123"
}

